title: The researchers found verbalizable bundled with 4 other properties.
pid: 0819caa2-3204-4886-95f6-67d50b6939cf
body: |2-
  "they went looking for representations satisfying one property (verbalizability — what the model is poised to say) and found that the other four came along uninvited: directed modulation, internal reasoning, flexible generalization, and selectivity."
